#: upgrade_guide.xml:465
msgid ""
"A number of patch files are provided and you should choose the one that "
"corresponds to the version of the board that you are currently running. For "
"example, if your current version is 3.3.0 and you are updating to 3.3.1, you "
"need the phpBB-3.3.0_to_3.3.1.patch file."
