#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: upgrade_guide.xml:480
msgid ""
"Upload the patch file to the parent directory containing the phpBB core "
"files (i.e. index.php, viewforum.php, etc.). With this done you should run "
"the following command: <code>patch -cl -d [PHPBB DIRECTORY] -p1 &lt; [PATCH "
